         <td style="padding-top: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 10px; padding-right: 10px;">
          <table class="contentbuilderBaseColumnRow" style="align-items: flex-start; width: 100%; background-color:;" role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
           <tbody>
            <tr valign="top">
             <td width="100%" class="columnCell" style="vertical-align: top;display: inline-block; float:left">
              <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; word-break:break-word;">
               <tbody>
                <tr>
                 <td>
                  <table style="width:100%; border-collapse: collapse; word-break:break-word;" id="contentRegion" role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" locked="0">
                   <tbody>
                    <tr>
                     <td align="Center"><img src="{[devName:Screenshot_20260911_at_13425PM]}" alt="" width="600" style="width: 100%; display: block; border: none; max-width: 100%; object-fit: fill;" /></td>
                    </tr>
                   </tbody>
                  </table></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                 <td>
                  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; word-break: break-word; font-size: 14px" id="contentRegion" role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" locked="0">
                   <tbody>
                    <tr>
                     <td style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><p><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="color:#000000;">Dear {{{IndividualApplication.Parent_Guardian_1_First_Name__c}}},</span></span></p><p style="line-height:1.38; margin-bottom:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-style: normal;"><span style="text-decoration: none;">Thank you for applying to Zeta Charter Schools</span></span></span></span><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">!&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="line-height:1.38; margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">We are so excited that you are considering Zeta for your family. Choosing a school is an important decision, and our Enrollment Team looks forward to supporting you every step of the way.</span></span></span></span></span><br /><br /><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:700"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Log in </span></span></span></span></span><a href="http://myportal.zetaschools.org/" style="text-decoration:none"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="color:#9900ff"><span style="font-weight:700"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:underline"><span style="text-decoration-skip-ink:none">here</span></span></span></span></span></span></a><font color="#1155cc">&nbsp;</font><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:700"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">to view your application.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p></td>
                    </tr>
                   </tbody>
                  </table></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                 <td>
                  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; word-break: break-word; font-size: 14px" id="contentRegion" role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" locked="0">
                   <tbody>
                    <tr>
                     <td style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><p style="line-height:1.38; margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:16px"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Lato,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">At Zeta Elementary, we believe the early years of school shape everything that follows. In warm, joyful, and structured classrooms, children build confidence, curiosity, and a lasting love of learning. Our teachers know each student deeply and provide the academic, social, and emotional support they need to thrive.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="line-height:1.38; margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:16px"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Lato,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Zeta students benefit from:</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
                      <ul>
                       <li aria-level="1" style="list-style-type:disc"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Lato,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">A </span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Lato,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:700"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">strong academic foundation</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Lato,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none"> that prepares them for long-term success</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>
                       <li aria-level="1" style="list-style-type:disc"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Lato,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">A school culture rooted in </span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Lato,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:700"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">love, belonging, and high expectations</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>
                       <li aria-level="1" style="list-style-type:disc"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Lato,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:700"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Thoughtful partnership with families</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Lato,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none"> at every stage</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>
                       <li aria-level="1" style="list-style-type:disc"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Lato,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">A </span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Lato,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:700"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">tuition-free public charter education</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Lato,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none"> open to all students</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>
                      </ul><p style="line-height:1.38; margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:16px"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Lato,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Our Enrollment Team will be your main point of contact throughout the enrollment process. We will share important updates, key dates, and opportunities to get to know our community, and we are always here to answer your questions.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p></td>
                    </tr>
                   </tbody>
                  </table></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                 <td>
                  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; word-break: break-word; font-size: 14px" id="contentRegion" role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" locked="0">
                   <tbody>
                    <tr>
                     <td style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><p style="line-height:1.38; margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:16px"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Lato,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">We would love to</span></span></span></span></span></span><a href="https://zetaschools.org/events-for-prospective-families/" style="text-decoration:none"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Lato,sans-serif"><span style="color:#1155cc"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:underline"><span style="-webkit-text-decoration-skip:none"><span style="text-decoration-skip-ink:none"> welcome you for a visit</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Lato,sans-serif"><span style="color:#1155cc"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none"></span></span></span></span></span></span></a><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Lato,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">at the Zeta Elementary School of your choice.&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="line-height:1.38; margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:16px"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Lato,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Thank you again for considering Zeta Elementary. We cannot wait to get to know your family!</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="line-height:1.38; margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:16px"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Lato,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Warmly,</span></span></span></span></span></span><br /><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Lato,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:700"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">The Zeta Enrollment Team</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="line-height:1.38; margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:16px"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Lato,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Zeta Charter Schools</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="line-height:1.38; margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:16px"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Lato,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:italic"><span style="text-decoration:none">Please reach out if you</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Lato,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none"></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Lato,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:italic"><span style="text-decoration:none">have any questions about Zeta, our Enrollment Team is here for you every step of the way. </span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-size:13.999999999999998pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Lato,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:italic"><span style="text-decoration:none">✉︎</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Lato,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:italic"><span style="text-decoration:none">&nbsp; </span></span></span></span></span></span><a href="mailto:enroll@zetaschools.org" style="text-decoration:none"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Lato,sans-serif"><span style="color:#1155cc"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:italic"><span style="text-decoration:underline"><span style="-webkit-text-decoration-skip:none"><span style="text-decoration-skip-ink:none">enroll@zetaschools.org</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></a><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Lato,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none"> 📞</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-size:10.5pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Roboto,sans-serif"><span style="color:#444746"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">(646) 480-1654</span></span></span></span></span></span></p></td>
                    </tr>
                   </tbody>
                  </table></td>
                </tr>
